			x: -11.0d
			y: 6.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["0BB1E0C2BAA903CD"]
			description: [
				"&8Verdant Haven的洞穴和深处隐藏着许多秘密。"
				""
				"探索地下世界，发现更多秘密："
				"• YUNG's Better Mineshafts"
